# Solve demo: constraints resolved by smazka-solve before rendering
#  - two vertices are 1 unit apart but min_dist requires >= 50
#  - a third vertex must stay inside a bbox
#  - linear_eq 2x+y=80 couples two coordinates
v 0 100 100
v 1 101 100
v 2 100 300
e 0 0 1
e 1 1 2
e 2 2 0
f 0 0 1 2
c 0 min_dist 0 1 50.0
c 1 bbox_clamp 2 50 200 150 400
c 2 linear_eq 80.0 0 2.0 3 1.0
s 0 0 0000FF 2 2
s 1 1 FF0000 2 2
s 2 2 00AA00 2 2
p 0 solid_fill 0 F0F0FF
